<event start="T158" end="T159">Wait! </event>
<event start="T159" end="T160">Now… </event>
<event start="T160" end="T161">• • </event>
<event start="T161" end="T162">You ninety… </event>
<event start="T165" end="T166">No, don't hang up! </event>
<event start="T166" end="T167">Please listen to me! </event>
<event start="T169" end="T170">Yo… </event>
<event start="T170" end="T171">• • • </event>
<event start="T171" end="T172">Ninety-one you began to work. </event>
<event start="T173" end="T174">Say yes! </event>
<event start="T174" end="T175">Finished, over! </event>
<event start="T175" end="T176">• </event>
<event start="T176" end="T177">Well, please! </event>
<event start="T177" end="T178">• </event>
<event start="T178" end="T179">E… </event>
<event start="T179" end="T180">Otherwise I will have to cut you off from the telephone line. </event>
