<event start="T235" end="T236">From ninety-four… </event>
<event start="T237" end="T239">Over! </event>
<event start="T239" end="T240">Please! </event>
<event start="T240" end="T241">• • </event>
<event start="T241" end="T243">What did you do after ninety-four? </event>
<event start="T243" end="T244">• • </event>
<event start="T244" end="T245">((breathes in)) </event>
<event start="T245" end="T246">What did you do after ninety-four? </event>
