<event start="T117" end="T118">• • </event>
<event start="T118" end="T119">Yes. </event>
<event start="T119" end="T120">((breathes in)) </event>
<event start="T120" end="T124">In the year nineteen ninety-nine I got a job for three years. </event>
<event start="T125" end="T126">• </event>
<event start="T126" end="T127">(in the factory). </event>
